# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/prefill-3 window (the masked tail pass of a prompt as a trace replay; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/prefill-3 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-pf3-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-pf3-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a NEW tag in every template (a rebuild under an existing tag keeps the old image). This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# C2_MODEL_REPO / C2_MODEL_REVISION (qwen_c2_checkpoint.py): a smoke job that carries them serves the Swift checkpoint (what production serves) from its own converted-weight directory; the keys are the same
# in every smoke job of this pack, so each pair differs by the profile alone. The prefix steps (AP1, R1, R2) do not forward the selection into their container and serve the base checkpoint: a tail pass
# replays the same traces on either.
# H0 (FIT, STOP): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-pf3-s5, the ship-5 candidate with the gate marker and QWEN_FAST_PREFILL_TAIL_TRACE=1, the arena at its
# default (320 MB a chip), on Swift, three short tests. This is the first card to capture a prefill trace in the served stack, so everything that can fail before a number
# exists fails here, cheaply: the compile pass (the conv op engaged on every GDN layer, the gate hook on every projection), the four captures (128, 256, 512, 1,024 rows)
# inside the arena, the HOLE CENSUS (every tensor the captures freed lies inside the arena: "uncovered=0" in the engaged line; a nonzero count means the allocator had free
# gaps below the arena and the attach refuses by name), and the arena coming back at its address. READ: c2_smoke_check clean; the lines in the container log: "[PINDIAG]
# lever N route installed: ... tailtrace=traced" once; on the arms "[PINDIAG] prefill tail trace engaged buckets=.. traces=<n> sink=<id> taps=5,19,33,47,61 arena_mb=<mb>
# arena_address=.. freed=<k> uncovered=0 capture_ms=.." once and one "[PF3] tail mode=traced bucket=.. valid=.. start=.. ms=.. stage_ms=.. replay_ms=.." per traced tail
# pass; on the control one "[PF3] tail mode=eager bucket=.. valid=.. start=.. ms=.." per tail pass below the 2,048-row bucket and no "engaged" line; no "fell back" line, no
# "[PF3] tail skip" line that the control would not also take (a skip is a call that ran the stock pass: vision, an untraced bucket, another page-table width, another tap
# set) and no program growth after the warm anywhere; the memory ledger: the trace region after the attach (P7) against the control's (T1 reads the control, so RECORD this
# one now: the traces' bytes are the arm minus the ship-5 figure of 69.9 MB used after the attach, the estimate being 82-218 MB for four traces) and the DRAM free after the
# attach (the arena's 320 MB comes out of it). STOP RULES: an attach error naming the arena, the hole census, the conv op or the hooks; "uncovered" above 0; a trace region
# that does not hold the four traces; a stall. CHECKPOINT READ (the workflow passes c2_smoke_check.py --expect-checkpoint): the container log holds "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint
# ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b@b4c84d42903a key=... weight_cache=.../weights-ckpt/<key> base_cache=... (the base cache is not read or written)" once, a "weight cache ...:
# found" line (the cache the Swift window built; this pack never builds it) and the worker's "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint bound ..." line; the models answer names
# ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b. RUN WITH THE CI PAUSED. Duration (estimate): 40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-pf3-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-pf3-s5
C2_MODEL_REPO=ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b
C2_MODEL_REVISION=b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady
C2_TELEMETRY=1
C2_BOX_MINUTES=75
